\newlabel{fig:qqq-prototype-concentration}{{4}{9}{Prototype concentration for a representative QQQ ProtoHedge model with 25 prototypes. The horizontal axis gives the number of most-used prototypes retained, and the vertical axis gives their cumulative assignment mass. The steep initial increase shows that a small subset of prototypes explains most decisions}{figure.caption.34}{}}
